  "details": "Can you please add a toggle to use the legacy voice system we use to have back before the earmuffs/new voice system came out. This new voice system with the earmuffs is sort of a pain to configure and I find myself adjusting it quite often. The old system worked very well in populated worlds. If the old system can be replicated with the new system then please add like a quick toggle button to set the earmuffs settings to it. Coming back to VRC after a few years of not playing I'm having a very hard time focusing on convos. I always end up expanding the muff radius or decreasing it constantly. The old system just worked without any adjustments. \n\nPlease this feature would be so awesome! :3\n\nMuch Love\n\n~ Ali",
